ok - each other state of an own copy the driver keeps refuses with its cause and the same disposition with and without --force, and the clean input closes the same way with --force
ok - a kept copy with an anchored but unlanded commit or an untracked .claude file is refused, with and without --force, and its retry asks the driver nothing
ok - an anchor-only prior copy passes the ordinary proof, is refused by the kept route after the driver's one call and one tar with its answer recorded, and two retries, with and without --force, ask the driver nothing
